<body>
    <h1>Github Runners for AI+</h1>
    <div class=3D"Section1">
        <p>On prem github runners are hosted in <a class=3D"external-link" =
href=3D"https://10.131.246.111/ui/" rel=3D"nofollow">https://10.131.246.111=
/ui/</a> (1Password =E2=80=9CDatacore FL Lab=E2=80=9D)</p>
<p><strong>Note, if the above doesn=E2=80=99t resolve (we have had some int=
ermittent issues with VPN giving wrong DNS ip) you can try the following:</=
strong></p>
<p>Access via <a class=3D"external-link" href=3D"https://vcenterswarm.engla=
b.local/" rel=3D"nofollow">https://vcenterswarm.englab.local/</a> (1Passwor=
d =E2=80=9CDatacore FL Lab=E2=80=9D)</p>
<p>with the following added to your /etc/host file</p>
<div class=3D"code panel pdl" style=3D"border-width: 1px;">
<div class=3D"codeContent panelContent pdl">
<pre class=3D"syntaxhighlighter-pre" data-syntaxhighlighter-params=3D"brush=
: bash; gutter: false; theme: Confluence" data-theme=3D"Confluence">10.131.=
246.111   vcenterswarm.englab.local</pre>
</div>
</div>
<p></p>
<p>VM=E2=80=99s are named =E2=80=9Caiplus_cicd_runner=E2=80=9D and =E2=80=
=9Caiplus_cicd_runner_cpu=E2=80=9D (1password =E2=80=9Caiplus_cicd_runner s=
sh =E2=80=9C, =E2=80=9Caiplus_cicd_runner_cpu ssh =E2=80=9C accordingly)</p=
><span class=3D"confluence-embedded-file-wrapper image-center-wrapper confl=
uence-embedded-manual-size"><img class=3D"confluence-embedded-image image-c=
enter" width=3D"468" loading=3D"lazy" src=3D"dc7835e8e7f4f84c2530ebf3aa80df=
e79bf3b0fca605f602e2bdb1e6df0bc310" data-image-src=3D"https://perifery.atla=
ssian.net/wiki/download/attachments/4362600471/Screenshot%202025-07-21%20at=
%203.08.56%E2%80%AFPM.png?version=3D1&amp;modificationDate=3D1753124957539&=
amp;cacheVersion=3D1&amp;api=3Dv2" data-height=3D"400" data-width=3D"474" d=
ata-unresolved-comment-count=3D"0" data-linked-resource-id=3D"4362600481" d=
ata-linked-resource-version=3D"1" data-linked-resource-type=3D"attachment" =
data-linked-resource-default-alias=3D"Screenshot 2025-07-21 at 3.08.56=E2=
=80=AFPM.png" data-base-url=3D"https://perifery.atlassian.net/wiki" data-li=
nked-resource-content-type=3D"image/png" data-linked-resource-container-id=
=3D"4362600471" data-linked-resource-container-version=3D"3" data-media-id=
=3D"0d6fd201-f0a8-4d5f-ac85-e165e9853a92" data-media-type=3D"file" height=
=3D"395"></span>
<p>These are ORG level runners managed at the organization level here:</p>
<p><a class=3D"external-link" href=3D"https://github.com/organizations/work=
flow-intelligence-nexus/settings/actions/runners" rel=3D"nofollow">https://=
github.com/organizations/workflow-intelligence-nexus/settings/actions/runne=
rs</a></p>
<p></p>
<p></p>
